    "cases": 52,
    "refusals": 6,
    "scope": "Actual pinned fitCircle invocation on an attached64x64 ByteProcessor, including area/subpixel/clipped/tiny and cardinal/noisy/duplicate/collinear/few-vertex point cases. Does not blanket-qualify all source constructors/attachments/style/fallback/platform variants."
  },
